{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"shaodi-e-o032a","title":"诏七十岁及病残官奴婢为良民并赈给","accounts":[{"id":"shaodi-e-o032a-account","label":"《三少帝纪》正文","text":"诏七十岁及病残官奴婢为良民并赈给","evidence":["shaodi-e-o032a-q"]},{"id":"shaodi-a-p008-judgment","label":"裴松之按","text":"裴松之指出即位已免六十岁以上官奴婢，与七八年后仍卖七十岁者难解。","evidence":["shaodi-q-p008-judgment"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wendi-p0129","role":"下诏","evidence":["shaodi-e-o032a-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":246,"label":"秋八月戊申","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"shaodi-y246","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"shaodi-q-o030","basis":"秋八月戊申"},"evidence":["shaodi-e-o032a-q","shaodi-q-o030","shaodi-q-b-b12b565bdbec15bb549b"]},"ordering_evidence":"shaodi-e-o032a-q","source_order":[4,114,"O032a"],"order":1037}],"persons":[{"id":"wendi-p0129","name":"曹芳","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"shaodi-e-o032a-q","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-cc5f0ad5f835c82c7ca9","layer":"original","quote":"秋八月，戊申〖14〗，诏曰：“属到市观见所斥卖官奴婢〖15〗，年皆七十，或癃疾残病；所谓‘天民之穷’者也〖16〗。且官以其力竭而复鬻之〖17〗，进退无谓〖18〗。其悉遣为良民；若有不能自存者，郡县赈给之。”﹝一﹞","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":113,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":106,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-q-b-b12b565bdbec15bb549b","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-b12b565bdbec15bb549b","layer":"modern","quote":"〖12〗七年：正始七年（公元 246）。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":128,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-9b6236e5001b76c5de88","start":0,"end":20,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-q-o030","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-4bf73c4c06612837c692","layer":"original","quote":"七年春二月〖12〗，幽州刺史毌丘俭讨高句骊。","sect